# Verify build (Tally app)

After changing imports, shadcn UI, Vite aliases, or Operator/Register surfaces under `apps/tally`:

## Do

- Run from `apps/tally`: `npm run build` (runs `tsc -b && vite build`)
- Fix resolve errors before claiming done — “file exists” is not enough if Vite can’t resolve `@/…`
- Start/restart `npm run dev` **from `apps/tally`** (not monorepo root) so `vite.config.ts` aliases apply

## Don't

- Ship UI that only typechecks in the editor
- Assume a running Vite process picked up new `src/components/ui` without a restart
- Run `vite` from the repo root without the app’s config
